WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:01.350
What?!

00:02.220 --> 00:06.900
She's back. And as the Head of the Bureau of all things.

00:06.900 --> 00:13.490
The world's greatest traitor and the Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures's greatest mistake is back?

00:13.490 --> 00:15.260
Even a death sentence wasn't enough.

00:15.860 --> 00:17.140
The Empire's terrorist.

00:17.750 --> 00:19.490
Hiratsuka Raichou!

00:20.390 --> 00:22.580
It's dangerous. That woman's dangerous.

00:22.580 --> 00:25.420
The fun's only begun.

00:25.420 --> 00:27.750
It's showtime!

01:51.250 --> 01:54.670
It's absolutely rude to use rationality against frowziness.

01:54.670 --> 01:58.220
So allow me to show you the minimum frenzy required!

02:32.000 --> 02:34.560
Hey Yuuka. Yuuka.

02:34.560 --> 02:36.220
What is it, Yamamoto-kun?

02:36.220 --> 02:39.380
I'm Yamaguchi. Remember my name already.

02:39.380 --> 02:44.470
Anyway, Great Teacher Yuuka.
Please let me peek at your answers.

02:44.910 --> 02:48.100
No. Copying is simply a bad thing.

02:48.100 --> 02:51.320
I beg you. I'll give you my pudding during lunch.

02:51.320 --> 02:52.100
You like it, don't you?

02:52.100 --> 02:53.240
Pudding?

02:54.600 --> 02:58.320
No! You always say things like that and never keep your promises.

02:58.320 --> 03:00.970
I'm serious this time!

03:05.870 --> 03:08.370
W-What's wrong, Yamaguchi-kun?

03:08.370 --> 03:11.270
Sensei! Yamaguchi-kun is-

03:16.030 --> 03:18.930
E-Everyone! S-Sensei is-

03:28.570 --> 03:31.180
Those who don't behave are not customers.

03:31.940 --> 03:33.770
Mama-san, you're very strong.

03:33.770 --> 03:35.590
That man flew out.

03:35.590 --> 03:37.140
Don't worry, Milca-chan.

03:37.140 --> 03:39.080
Drinda-chan went easy on him.

03:39.080 --> 03:41.220
Why did that person all of a sudden start to go wild?

03:41.220 --> 03:42.360
Did he go into heat?

03:42.360 --> 03:45.610
It didn't look like that kind of going wild.

03:45.610 --> 03:46.240
Look.

03:46.240 --> 03:49.150
He looks like an animal now.

03:50.000 --> 03:53.630
Damn, we shouldn't have opened.

03:53.630 --> 03:54.860
What is this about?

04:07.720 --> 04:09.810
Eat...

04:09.880 --> 04:14.530
Eat... Just like animals do...

04:14.530 --> 04:16.670
Eat...

04:15.500 --> 04:17.730
Momo-san! Momo-san, hang in there!

04:19.190 --> 04:21.560
Is this an experiment, Hiratsuka Raichou?

04:22.360 --> 04:23.730
It's too early for it.

04:24.400 --> 04:26.820
Shizu-chan... Even Hi-chan...

04:32.790 --> 04:34.370
Stop it, you fool.

04:37.000 --> 04:40.410
No... Momo-san... Shizu-chan... Hi-chan...

04:40.410 --> 04:41.610
Why?

04:41.610 --> 04:43.380
No... No, no...

04:43.380 --> 04:45.780
No!

04:45.780 --> 04:48.350
Hey, human! It's annoying, so quit crying.

04:48.350 --> 04:51.870
Who are you to order me?! They were my first friends!

04:52.210 --> 04:53.520
And they're going through this...

04:53.880 --> 04:54.980
It's horrible.

04:54.980 --> 04:58.400
Do you understand what it feels like to lose friends?

04:58.400 --> 05:01.910
No, I don't, since I was just born.

05:01.910 --> 05:03.130
Then you stay out of this!

05:03.460 --> 05:07.630
They always looked at me and liked me!

05:07.930 --> 05:09.280
And yet...

05:09.280 --> 05:14.490
I see. So the definition of a friend is a slave that does anything for you?

05:16.000 --> 05:18.420
You don't have to do anything for them, right?

05:18.420 --> 05:19.980
That sounds like a good deal.

05:19.980 --> 05:22.000
I'd like a friend, too.

05:23.730 --> 05:25.980
N-No. I would...

05:25.980 --> 05:30.680
There should be something I can do for them, too...

05:32.630 --> 05:33.970
It's no time to be crying.

05:34.640 --> 05:40.610
Now, it is time to punch the face of whoever is doing this and save my three friends.

05:42.610 --> 05:44.650
Thank you, Dekamelon-san.

05:44.650 --> 05:46.910
I don't understand why you thanked me.

05:47.410 --> 05:49.460
Plus, I'm not Dekamelon.

05:49.460 --> 05:50.610
My name is Ma-

05:50.610 --> 05:51.290
Kyouka!

05:51.290 --> 05:52.740
Chika-dono! Are you all right?!

05:52.740 --> 05:55.910
You're late! Come within two seconds if I call you!

05:55.910 --> 06:00.590
I don't want to be devoted to you to the extent of breaking human limits.

06:00.590 --> 06:05.080
We got your message via Cellphone, and we had to go get Yuuka.

06:05.080 --> 06:07.730
I'm at my limits.

06:08.430 --> 06:09.180
Nee-sama!

06:09.180 --> 06:10.460
Yuuka-chan.

06:11.560 --> 06:13.880
Thank goodness you're all right.

06:14.540 --> 06:17.710
In any case, what is happening?

06:18.050 --> 06:18.690
Umm...

06:18.690 --> 06:19.740
Who's this?

06:23.610 --> 06:24.460
Nii-san.

06:24.830 --> 06:25.400
Eh?

06:25.400 --> 06:28.430
We don't care about Dekamelon right now!

06:28.430 --> 06:31.800
We must take refuge in a safe place.

06:31.800 --> 06:33.580
Where would a safe place be?

06:38.470 --> 06:41.670
What is it this time?!

06:53.600 --> 06:55.970
Warning. Warning.

06:55.970 --> 06:59.810
Order 000003 has been given.

06:59.810 --> 07:05.000
Toudai Defense Base is now in emergency defense mode.

07:05.410 --> 07:10.370
Escape routes alpha, beta, and gamma are all in operation.

07:10.680 --> 07:11.710
Troop A on standby.

07:12.460 --> 07:17.830
Civilians who do not understand the meaning of this announcement, please take refuge immediately.

07:22.570 --> 07:24.470
Emergency defense mode...

07:25.210 --> 07:26.540
Why is this happening?

07:26.990 --> 07:28.110
Hey now.

07:28.460 --> 07:32.560
What's the hurry, Hanayama Vice-Head?

07:33.800 --> 07:34.570
Spider.

07:34.570 --> 07:37.260
Yes, Spider the ninja.

07:37.260 --> 07:39.950
Is this Raichou's order?

07:40.250 --> 07:43.120
Why is she escalating the issue?

07:43.120 --> 07:45.000
What does she have in mind?

07:45.000 --> 07:51.700
Even if you ask me, she drifts from one place to another, leaving me no chance to catch her.

07:51.700 --> 07:55.450
She's a butterfly, so it's those wings that must be giving her the freedom.

07:56.460 --> 07:57.190
Forget it.

07:57.890 --> 07:59.040
Where are you headed to?

07:59.040 --> 08:00.690
To the Counter-Measure Room.

08:00.690 --> 08:02.210
I will give orders from there.

08:02.210 --> 08:04.540
I can't let you do that.

08:06.000 --> 08:08.710
Spider, you...

08:08.710 --> 08:14.260
Yes, I'm a spider, yet I work for a butterfly! Funny?

08:14.820 --> 08:16.930
Pardon me.

08:17.780 --> 08:23.030
If you take action now, I'll get yelled at by her.

08:24.440 --> 08:29.080
So please deal with our poor treatment of you for a while, Vice-Head.

08:29.080 --> 08:33.700
I repeat. All civilians, please take refuge immediately.

08:34.270 --> 08:39.740
If you do not, your safety cannot be guaranteed.

08:34.760 --> 08:36.110
W-What?

08:36.300 --> 08:38.580
Where are we supposed to escape to?

08:38.580 --> 08:40.200
What exactly is going on?

08:40.220 --> 08:42.200
I don't have any idea either.

08:42.890 --> 08:44.460
W-What is this?

08:44.460 --> 08:48.500
Wow. The city simply transformed.

08:51.560 --> 08:54.010
Opening an escape route.

08:54.550 --> 08:58.730
All escape routes will close in seven minutes.

08:59.050 --> 09:05.800
Anyone left out will not have their safety guaranteed.

09:00.220 --> 09:01.120
W-Wait!

09:01.120 --> 09:01.850
Hurry!

09:02.300 --> 09:03.580
We should go, too.

09:03.950 --> 09:08.940
Yes. We might be fine, but honored sisters will be in danger out here.

09:09.220 --> 09:11.470
I agree with you, Father.

09:11.470 --> 09:14.570
It makes me wonder who's making the announcement.

09:14.570 --> 09:18.070
I don't like the idea too much, but everyone, follow me!

09:20.780 --> 09:22.430
Warning. Warning.

09:22.430 --> 09:26.690
Battery AAKN lost control due to an unknown reason.

09:26.690 --> 09:27.920
N-No way...

09:26.790 --> 09:29.420
Please hurry to an escape route.

09:32.250 --> 09:36.420
Too bad. I won't let you escape that easily.

09:36.420 --> 09:37.800
This voice is...

09:45.810 --> 09:48.560
Ciao. How have you all been?

09:48.560 --> 09:50.730
I see. That's great.

09:50.730 --> 09:56.510
But, if you want to remain well,
you have to give Black Thirteen to me.

09:56.510 --> 09:57.660
Dr. Gebok!

09:57.660 --> 09:59.200
So you've finally shown up, you source of all evil!

09:59.740 --> 10:03.210
Thirteen, come to me.

10:03.210 --> 10:05.580
This time, I will tune you up to perfection.

10:06.060 --> 10:08.160
Doctor, I'm Hyouka.

10:08.160 --> 10:10.240
I'm not your toy anymore.

10:10.240 --> 10:13.300
It disgusts me to be touched by you.

10:14.560 --> 10:17.080
Then this means we don't have a deal?

10:17.080 --> 10:20.460
Obviously! Hyouka is part of our family now!

10:20.460 --> 10:22.050
We would never give him to you!

10:23.650 --> 10:30.520
That's too bad. If you would give him to me, I was planning to give you the recipe to cure the beastmen.

10:31.230 --> 10:32.410
What?

10:32.410 --> 10:36.080
I'm the one that made the drug that turns humans into beastmen.

10:36.080 --> 10:38.490
Of course I know how to make the drug to cure that.

10:38.490 --> 10:43.740
Look look. If you don't hurry, those people will be in danger.

10:44.310 --> 10:46.870
Momo-san. Shizu-chan. Hi-chan.

10:47.500 --> 10:48.330
Chika.

10:49.360 --> 10:51.470
You're such scum!

10:51.470 --> 10:53.590
Ah, don't worry about it.

10:55.260 --> 10:58.310
Not the first time for some people, but nice to meet you.

10:58.310 --> 11:00.300
Hello, I'm a magical girl.

11:00.300 --> 11:01.510
Hiratsuka Raichou!

11:01.510 --> 11:05.220
Hallelujah! It's Ouka-kun. Long time no see.

11:05.220 --> 11:06.800
Why are you here?

11:06.800 --> 11:09.350
Why the scary look?

11:09.350 --> 11:12.160
I brought you information for your benefit.

11:12.160 --> 11:12.980
Information for my benefit?

11:12.980 --> 11:14.090
Yes.

11:14.550 --> 11:21.860
You see, about the drug to cure the beastmen: The Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures has already developed it, too.

11:21.860 --> 11:23.390
Yay! Yay!

11:23.390 --> 11:26.030
Then why won't you use it right away?!

11:26.030 --> 11:28.720
Because, look.

11:31.540 --> 11:34.630
We're trying to distribute it by helicopter.

11:34.630 --> 11:38.460
But with him around, we don't know if we'll get shot.

11:38.460 --> 11:42.840
So we can't get it to a low enough altitude where the antidote will be effective.

11:42.840 --> 11:49.180
To cut to the chase, if you would stop him from shooting, everything would be solved.

11:49.180 --> 11:51.380
Simple, isn't it?

11:51.380 --> 11:52.270
Okay?

11:52.700 --> 11:55.200
You're telling us to beat Gebok?

11:55.200 --> 11:57.590
Why us?

11:57.590 --> 12:00.190
I thought you were against Operation Cozy Family.

12:00.190 --> 12:01.950
No, no~

12:01.950 --> 12:07.270
I don't know what gave you that idea, but I'm in favor of the Operation.

12:07.270 --> 12:11.910
But to deal with those who are opposed,
I need a strong enough basis to shut them up with.

12:11.910 --> 12:14.040
Basis?

12:14.040 --> 12:18.000
So show us your power.

12:18.000 --> 12:21.680
Whether or not Family Frenzy is really something worth protecting or not.

12:21.680 --> 12:25.760
Prove it by putting an end to this craziness.

12:25.760 --> 12:26.760
Yay.

12:26.760 --> 12:29.430
What Family Frenzy is worth, eh?

12:29.430 --> 12:31.890
How long are you going to be whispering there?!

12:35.190 --> 12:38.690
Interesting! We'll show you the bond we, the Family Frenzy, are bound by!

12:38.690 --> 12:44.400
Conveniently, I was in the mood of punching that fake scientist in the face!

12:44.400 --> 12:45.280
Mother.

12:45.280 --> 12:46.140
Kyouka!

12:47.010 --> 12:49.020
Hyouka and Gekka, go support Kyouka.

12:49.020 --> 12:51.740
Teika, you take Yuuka and the rest to a safe place.

12:51.740 --> 12:52.430
Okay.

12:52.430 --> 12:53.990
This way, Chika-dono.

12:53.990 --> 12:54.750
Yes.

12:55.890 --> 12:57.720
I guess we have no choice but to do this.

12:58.030 --> 12:59.740
I'm counting on you, everyone.

13:01.750 --> 13:04.160
That's what I want to see.

13:09.070 --> 13:10.680
Let's go, Hyouka and Gekka!

13:10.680 --> 13:13.810
We'll destroy Gebok with formation KYK!

13:13.810 --> 13:16.060
Mother, what's KYK?

13:16.060 --> 13:18.430
Act accordingly to the situation!

13:18.430 --> 13:19.900
That's the plan?

13:20.960 --> 13:23.780
Attacking from the front? How dangerous.

13:23.780 --> 13:24.850
Take this.

13:24.850 --> 13:25.400
What?!

13:28.490 --> 13:29.700
Gekka, don't move.

13:32.400 --> 13:33.700
Prepare, Gebok!

13:34.520 --> 13:35.870
I don't think so.

13:38.630 --> 13:41.470
Ah, so you formed your barrier?

13:41.470 --> 13:44.770
Oh, but no. That just won't do, Thirteen!

13:45.170 --> 13:49.560
See, the barrier takes up energy,
so you can't keep it up for too long.

13:49.560 --> 13:50.850
You've got to fight with your brain.

13:50.850 --> 13:51.850
You've got to learn.

13:51.850 --> 13:53.180
You've got to evolve.

13:53.180 --> 13:55.850
Just like me!

14:05.680 --> 14:06.980
What?!

14:07.650 --> 14:08.690
Come on!

14:10.870 --> 14:12.940
Oh, fantastic.

14:12.940 --> 14:16.500
The power of science is infinite!

14:28.630 --> 14:29.790
Hyouka!

14:30.340 --> 14:33.470
What's wrong? The game's only just starting.

14:41.870 --> 14:44.570
W-W-W-We've got more of them!

14:44.570 --> 14:46.260
What should we do, Teika-kun?

14:53.830 --> 14:54.990
Now!

14:57.210 --> 14:58.350
Hurry.

14:58.350 --> 14:59.210
Nee-sama!

14:59.210 --> 15:00.050
Okay.

15:00.420 --> 15:02.080
Please wait!

15:05.090 --> 15:05.920
Momo-san!

15:25.120 --> 15:27.650
My art was learned directly from Drinda!

15:27.650 --> 15:30.470
I won't forgive anyone that makes my sister cry!

15:31.120 --> 15:32.660
Ginichi-san.

15:32.660 --> 15:34.160
Spin spin spin.

15:34.160 --> 15:38.040
Spin spin spin.

15:39.480 --> 15:41.830
You can't call it a fight if you only run away.

15:42.740 --> 15:45.080
Does he have infinite power?

15:45.080 --> 15:46.540
What happened to Hyouka?!

15:49.690 --> 15:51.470
What's the matter, Thirteen?

15:51.470 --> 15:54.080
The experiment's still going on, V!

15:54.080 --> 15:58.100
Stand. Stand up. Report your emotion to me.

15:58.100 --> 16:01.650
Is it frustrating to see that your family can't do anything?

16:01.650 --> 16:02.980
Is it sad?

16:03.520 --> 16:06.260
Take this! And this! And this!

16:06.260 --> 16:08.790
Do you hate me, V?!

16:11.530 --> 16:12.950
Kyouka! Gekka!

16:14.440 --> 16:15.710
I don't think so.

16:17.760 --> 16:22.660
Spin spin spin.

16:22.660 --> 16:25.460
Trying to shoot at me is futile, futile, futile!

16:30.030 --> 16:32.590
Hyouka, you mustn't move.

16:32.590 --> 16:34.870
I'm fine. I can still fight.

16:34.870 --> 16:36.910
That's the spirit, Hyouka.

16:37.530 --> 16:38.430
Kyouka.

16:38.430 --> 16:41.930
I hate to admit it, but at this rate,
we'll only continue to get pushed.

16:41.930 --> 16:44.650
We need your big shot.

16:44.650 --> 16:50.730
While Gekka and I distract him, charge up your energy and blast him with the best shot you've got.

16:50.730 --> 16:52.990
Okay. Leave it to me, Mother.

16:52.990 --> 16:54.780
Let's got, Gekka!

16:57.700 --> 17:00.410
You just don't learn, do you?

17:00.410 --> 17:02.360
Then allow me to use you as a target.

17:03.870 --> 17:05.250
Kyouka! Gekka!

17:12.890 --> 17:14.050
Hyouka...

17:15.430 --> 17:17.150
I'd better do something.

17:17.640 --> 17:20.930
If I could stop his attacks... even for a split second...

17:28.180 --> 17:29.060
I see.

17:29.060 --> 17:30.440
Kyouka, duck!

17:30.440 --> 17:31.360
What?

17:31.360 --> 17:33.250
Ready, Kyouka?!

17:33.900 --> 17:36.880
If it's this timing, Gebok shouldn't be able to see me.

17:42.450 --> 17:43.240
What?

17:43.240 --> 17:43.940
What?

17:43.940 --> 17:44.880
What?

17:44.880 --> 17:46.290
What?!

17:46.290 --> 17:47.750
Now, Hyouka!

17:47.750 --> 17:50.750
Before Gebok restores himself, finish him with one shot!

17:53.760 --> 17:54.920
Listen, Nii-san.

17:55.840 --> 17:57.350
The code is Lucifer Cannon.

17:57.840 --> 18:03.640
Stick your right arm out, say the code,
and your greatest weapon will activate.

18:03.850 --> 18:06.850
Don't point it down or sideways no matter what.

18:06.900 --> 18:08.140
Who are you exactly?

18:08.140 --> 18:11.350
Why do you know a secret of my body that even I don't know?

18:12.860 --> 18:14.030
That's all help I'll give you.

18:15.530 --> 18:17.170
Don't get destroyed, Nii-san.

18:17.590 --> 18:18.570
My name is Man-

18:20.700 --> 18:23.200
That was nothing.

18:25.410 --> 18:28.440
Dr. Gebok. Run if you like.

18:28.440 --> 18:29.930
If you stay there, you'll die.

18:29.930 --> 18:30.680
I think.

18:31.650 --> 18:32.970
Lucifer Cannon.

18:54.820 --> 18:56.190
Th-This is...

18:56.190 --> 18:57.820
Marvelous!

19:04.990 --> 19:06.240
Amazing...

19:08.250 --> 19:12.030
I'm a beautiful electric butterfly.

19:12.030 --> 19:16.170
I've been made with love electric wave.

19:16.170 --> 19:24.730
You will never catch me, but just looking at me makes you feel good, right?

19:42.260 --> 19:43.350
Where am I?

19:45.360 --> 19:46.160
Onee-sama.

19:46.160 --> 19:47.790
Momo-san.

19:48.780 --> 19:49.660
I'm so glad!

19:56.730 --> 19:59.050
Looks like they're keeping their promise.

20:00.560 --> 20:01.860
I guess.

20:01.860 --> 20:05.260
But who was that crazy woman, anyways?

20:06.930 --> 20:08.110
She's...

20:10.190 --> 20:13.600
Anyway, case closed.

20:13.600 --> 20:15.070
Good work, everyone.

20:15.560 --> 20:17.110
But before that...

20:17.110 --> 20:20.860
You! Your punishment for shooting at me from behind remains!

20:20.860 --> 20:23.250
Dragging you around the city won't be enough.

20:23.250 --> 20:26.450
Didn't you think of the possibility that the bullet might hit me?

20:26.450 --> 20:30.190
If a bullet I shoot could actually hit you, I wouldn't be having so much trouble.

20:30.530 --> 20:32.960
It's only natural that you could dodge it.

20:36.900 --> 20:37.920
There they are!

20:37.920 --> 20:39.850
Dad! Mom!

20:39.850 --> 20:41.840
Are you all safe?

20:41.840 --> 20:43.810
Yuuka! Chika-san!

20:43.810 --> 20:45.010
Teika and Ginka, too!

20:45.610 --> 20:48.510
Family Frenzy will always be together and will live forever!

20:56.050 --> 20:58.460
Thank you for the show.

20:58.460 --> 21:07.280
I've tested if you could survive the expected catastrophe through this situation which simulated the event.

21:07.280 --> 21:11.790
Everything is for the expected catastrophe.

21:16.750 --> 21:18.800
Good day.

21:22.890 --> 21:23.760
What?

21:25.180 --> 21:26.870
Good day, Onee-sama!

21:26.870 --> 21:29.190
We've been waiting for you, Onee-sama.

21:29.190 --> 21:31.600
Wow, everyone's gathered up...

21:31.600 --> 21:33.520
What's the occasion?

21:33.520 --> 21:34.950
Onee-sama, Onee-sama.

21:34.950 --> 21:37.190
She's Mari-cchi, the Earth Eater.

21:37.860 --> 21:40.830
Hi. Looks like we're indebted to you.

21:40.830 --> 21:44.190
You're amazing to have solved that mystery alone!

21:44.930 --> 21:45.940
Alone?

21:45.940 --> 21:50.260
U-Um, I'm not sure what kind of
misunderstanding occurred. I haven't...

21:50.260 --> 21:52.020
No need to be embarrassed.

21:52.020 --> 21:54.910
You are indeed the Onee-sama I have faith in.

22:05.870 --> 22:08.500
Spin spin spin.

23:40.140 --> 23:44.960
Twinkle twinkle, spin around,
chant a spell, and the case is solved.

23:45.270 --> 23:48.630
You don't mean spin around, smash, crash, kaboom?

